        "alt": "青蛙 - 家长指南 — 如何培养好奇心",
        "url": "https://assets.tangobook.co.kr/1777550146108-%EB%AC%BC%EA%B3%BC%EC%9C%A1%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC%EC%98%A4%EA%B0%80%EB%8A%94%ED%8F%B4%EC%A7%9D%ED%8F%B4%EC%A7%9D%EC%A0%90%ED%94%84%EB%8C%80%EC%9E%A5%EA%B0%9C%EA%B5%AC%EB%A6%AC-%EB%B3%B5%EC%82%AC%EB%B3%B81-illustration-page14-1777552129913.webp",
        "text": "<h2>父母指南 — 如何培养好奇心</h2><p>春天观察蝌蚪，留意它们长出腿的变态过程几天（观察后回到原位）。听着青蛙叫声，聊聊“雄性唱的歌”会很好。</p>",
        "caption": "蝌蚪观察",
        "image_style": "",
        "image_prompt": "A parent and child observing tadpoles in a pond, warm children's book illustration, no text"
      }
